  "created": "2026-09-27T11:13:13.63Z",
  "description": "Turns Scrapy.Net crawls into AI-ready knowledge: article and metadata extraction (OpenGraph, JSON-LD), text normalization, chunking, SimHash near-duplicate detection, content change detection and incremental re-crawls, local hashing embeddings or OpenAI-compatible embeddings, an in-memory SIMD vector store (plus Qdrant), extractive and LLM summarization, keyword/Naive Bayes/LLM categorization, and a RAG ingestion pipeline with a queryable knowledge base. Dibuat oleh Gravicode Studios, dipimpin oleh Kang Fadhil.",
